MODULE: RetiredSagaReentersPoison
TARGET: NoReseedLoop
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a post-reseed deterministic fault starts another poison cycle
PERTURBS: Escalate

--- FIND
                    IF quarantine THEN "quarantined" ELSE IF poison THEN "poisoned" ELSE @]
--- REPLACE
                    IF quarantine THEN "poisoned" ELSE IF poison THEN "poisoned" ELSE @]
--- END
